  notes = notes || ' || ADVERSARIAL RE-READ 2026-07-26 - STRONGER THAN RECORDED, AND A T1 CANDIDATE. Abstract: "An adjustable seating rig was used to create the three-dimensional shape of a static lounge chair. Elderly subjects from long-term care and rehabilitation hospital wards tested the chair. Questionnaires and video tapes were used to evaluate their comfort, posture, safety and ease of ingress/egress. The test shape was modified on the basis of results and retested to a total of four shapes." That is ITERATIVE EXPERIMENTAL MANIPULATION OF THE PARAMETER UNDER DESIGN (chair geometry) with outcome measurement on the served population - which is the tier-system T1 condition. DELIBERATELY NOT RE-TIERED UPWARD HERE: re-tiering on an abstract is precisely the inflation risk batch 3 was criticised for, and the whole point of this pass is to stop treating located-as-verified. Flagged T1-CANDIDATE pending full text. Toronto (Univ of Toronto, Dept of Surgery).',
  updated_at='2026-07-26', updated_by_session='session_2026-07-26-energy-conservation-rest-points-seating-adversarial'
