  notes = notes || ' || ADVERSARIAL RE-READ 2026-07-26 - WEAKER THAN RECORDED, DOWNGRADED TO GREY. Abstract: "Requirements for three types of chairs for the elderly are presented. A description of a typical user of each chair provides a reference for the level of ability that must be accommodated. Features of the chairs ... are discussed." No study, no participants, no measurement - this is a DESIGN-CONSIDERATIONS DISCUSSION PAPER. Batch 3 filed it at tier 3 identically to REF-00961, an experimental study, having read neither. Under tier-system section 5 the T3 species split matters: T3-clinical maps to the full band, T3-grey to the weak band. grey_flag set to 1 so this anchors at weak band only. Downgrading is the safe direction to move on an abstract; that is why it is done here and the REF-00961 upgrade is not.',
